{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1CH","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"历代志上","commonName":"历代志上","title":"历代志上","order":13,"numberOfChapters":29,"sha256":"fc4564236e3ad71076ed44b678c67d6581a3c5d084477a871eeffdf3670ae182","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":29,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CH/29.json","totalNumberOfVerses":938},"chapter":{"number":10,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["扫罗之死"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["非利士人与以色列人交战，以色列人败逃，许多人在基利波山被杀。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["非利士人穷追扫罗及其众子，杀了扫罗的儿子约拿单、亚比拿达和麦基舒亚。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["扫罗周围战事激烈，他被弓箭手发现后射成重伤，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["就对为他拿兵器的人说：“拔出你的刀来刺死我吧！免得那些未受割礼的人来凌辱我。”但拿兵器的人非常害怕，不敢动手，扫罗就拿起刀来，伏刀自尽了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["拿兵器的人看见扫罗已死，也伏刀自尽了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["这样，扫罗和他三个儿子及全家都死了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["住在山谷中的以色列人见以色列军败逃、扫罗及其众子已死，都弃城而逃。于是，非利士人占据了那些城邑。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["次日，非利士人来剥阵亡者的衣物，发现扫罗及其众子横尸基利波山，"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["就剥下扫罗的盔甲，割下他的头颅，并派人去非利士全境向他们的偶像和民众通告消息。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["他们把扫罗的盔甲放在他们的神庙里，把他的头颅挂在大衮神庙中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["基列·雅比人听见非利士人对扫罗的所作所为，"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["他们所有的勇士就去把扫罗和他儿子们的尸体运到雅比，葬在雅比的橡树下，并禁食七天。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["扫罗死了，因为他对耶和华不忠，不听从祂的教诲，甚至去求问灵媒，"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["而不求问耶和华。因此，耶和华使他被杀，把王位交给了耶西的儿子大卫。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CH/10.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CH/11.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CH/9.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}